{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The fix seems to have worked: the AssertionErrors in render and distribute are gone, and I couldn't reproduce the ZeroDivisionError under fuzzing, since ratio_resolve already guards its sum with `or 1`. Next I'll run mypy and black on the two changed files, then add tests to tests/test_table.py and test_tools.py.\n\nI'm going to add a regression test covering the reproduction case, plus one for the zero-sum path in ratio_distribute. I also want a test confirming the \"Load\" column still shows its content.\n\n","thinkingSignature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1oYWlrdS01LjUtMjAyNjEwMDd8Y2xhdWRlLW9uLWF3cyJ9"},{"type":"text","text":"Before the fix the fuzzer hit `AssertionError` in both `ratio_distribute` and table rendering; after the fix it hits no errors across about 3000 ratio cases and roughly 1,300 table configurations. I didn't reproduce a `ZeroDivisionError`, and the code paths I checked are already guarded. Next I'll add regression tests and run the linters."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01LwiLdMu7CBJ2E6Qdcwjv12","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /app && cat >> tests/test_table.py <<'EOF'\n\n\ndef test_flexible_column_keeps_minimum_width_when_constrained():\n    console = Console(width=60, record=True, file=io.StringIO(), legacy_windows=False)\n    table = Table(title=\"Worker Dashboard\", expand=True)\n    table.add_column(\"Service\", width=22)\n    table.add_column(\"Host\", width=18)\n    table.add_column(\"Load\", ratio=1)\n    table.add_row(\"Database Primary\", \"db-node-01.internal\", \"82%\")\n    console.print(table)\n    assert \"Load\" in console.export_text()\n    assert \"82%\" in console.export_text()\n\n\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\"width\", range(0, 60, 3))\ndef test_expand_tables_never_raise(width):\n    console = Console(width=width, file=io.StringIO())\n    table = Table(expand=True, min_width=30)\n    table.add_column(\"a\", ratio=0)\n    table.add_column(\"b\", ratio=0)\n    console.print(table)\n    console.print(Table(expand=True).add_column(\"c\", ratio=1) or Table())\nEOF\ngrep -n \"^import pytest\\|^from rich.console\\|^from rich.table\" tests/test_table.py | head; cat >> tests/test_tools.py <<'EOF'\n\n\ndef test_ratio_distribute_zero_ratios():\n    assert ratio_distribute(10, [0, 0]) == [5, 5]\n    assert ratio_distribute(-4, [1, 1]) == [-2, -2]\nEOF\nexport PYTHONPATH=/app; python3 -m pytest tests/test_table.py tests/test_tools.py tests/test_ratio.py -q 2>&1 | tail -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"openrouter","model":"anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5","usage":{"input":2,"output":977,"cacheRead":47970,"cacheWrite":445,"totalTokens":49394,"cost":{"input":2.0000000000000002e-7,"output":0.0004885,"cacheRead":0.0004797,"cacheWrite":0.000055625,"total":0.001024025,"totalFromProvider":true},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":231},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794166449598,"providerThinkingLevel":"medium","responseId":"msg_011Cgr2A6XXofsYvvV3G1TdZ","rawStopReason":"tool_use","durationMs":4432,"thinkingLevel":"medium"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01LwiLdMu7CBJ2E6Qdcwjv12","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"6:import pytest\n9:from rich.console import Console\n12:from rich.table import Column, Table\nFAILED tests/test_table.py::test_flexible_column_keeps_minimum_width_when_constrained\nFAILED tests/test_tools.py::test_ratio_distribute_zero_ratios - assert [0, 0]...\n2 failed, 52 passed in 1.99s\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":2436,"timestamp":1794166456470}]}
